      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my lawn in portland is looking kinda yellow and thin in some spots. im seeing some weird purplish tints too. can u explain what npk ratios actually mean on fertilizer bags and how i can tell if i'm missing phosphorus specifically?",
      "source": "evaluator"
